  "goodToKnow": "Die Fertigstellung is completion, especially of buildings and big projects: die Fertigstellung des neuen Bahnhofs. The most famous German example is Berlin's BER airport: planned to open in 2011, its Fertigstellung kept slipping until it finally opened in October 2020, nine years late. The verb is fertigstellen: Das Haus wird im Mai fertiggestellt. It's built from fertig (finished) and stellen (to put)."
